WEBVTT

00:00:00.019 --> 00:00:03.659
The thought of spending eight hundred
dollars or more on a dog crate

00:00:04.299 --> 00:00:07.499
seemed a bit, mm, beyond my budget.

00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:11.629
But upon looking further into it,
realized that they have a partnership

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:17.259
program with Fragile and Whim where you
can rent one of the Impact dog crates,

00:00:17.939 --> 00:00:20.220
and I decided to give it a go
